1
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:15,900
Well, well.

2
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,080
Director Geng.

3
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,960
Congratulations!

4
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,840
Reinstated to your post.

5
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,100
Jia Dongping.

6
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,860
Everything you confessed to earlier...

7
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,920
was just dodging the main issues.

8
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,060
I hope you'll cooperate properly with our inquiry.

9
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,340
I told your colleagues everything I could.

10
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:38,660
I don't know

11
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,600
what else you want to hear.

12
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,180
I know

13
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:46,680
the person who had you turn yourself in

14
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,080
must have promised you a lot.

15
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:50,740
But let me tell you,

16
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,200
in all these years,

17
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,660
handling so many cases

18
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:57,460
and dealing with so many people,

19
00:00:57,740 --> 00:00:59,780
not a single one ever delivered on their promises.

20
00:01:00,120 --> 00:01:00,960
Do you understand?

21
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:05,620
You don't need to intimidate me like this.

22
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:08,440
A guy like me doesn't care about anything.

23
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,600
There's something

24
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:12,940
I thought over,

25
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,500
and I think I should tell you after all.

26
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,080
Your mother has a heart condition.

27
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:22,960
You know that.

28
00:01:23,420 --> 00:01:24,780
Since you've been in here these past few days,

29
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:26,940
she hasn't been sleeping well.

30
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:28,600
She had a sudden heart attack

31
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,740
and was rushed to the hospital.

32
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,200
Half an hour ago,

33
00:01:32,560 --> 00:01:33,940
I just received word.

34
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:36,460
I...

35
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:38,180
How is my mom?

36
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:44,280
Say something! How is my mom?

37
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:47,100
The surgery was a success.

38
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:49,560
She's currently recovering.

39
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,260
You can rest assured.

40
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:57,740
Didn't you just say you don't care about anything?

41
00:01:58,700 --> 00:01:59,980
Yet what I see is

42
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,700
that you still care deeply about your mother.

43
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,480
Right?

44
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,240
About my mom...

45
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,620
I'm truly grateful to you all.

46
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,760
I admit,

47
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,540
you people genuinely have a heart.

48
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:17,940
However,

49
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,940
my hands are tied.

50
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:26,500
This debt of gratitude...

51
00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:30,240
I might never be able to repay you in this lifetime.

52
00:02:32,140 --> 00:02:33,440
In the next life, then.

53
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,320
In the next life,

54
00:02:36,720 --> 00:02:37,600
I'll definitely repay it.

55
00:02:59,460 --> 00:03:00,980
Let's go back to that point earlier.

56
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,460
Where are the people who said they'd help you?

57
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:06,520
They didn't even know something happened to your mother,

58
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,320
and none of them showed up.

59
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,220
How are they supposed to help you?

60
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:12,960
How could you believe they'd help you?

61
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,200
Do you have anything else to say,

62
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,320
Jia Dongping?

63
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,840
A man isn't afraid of taking the fall;

64
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:49,960
he only fears leaving over a hundred brothers stranded.

65
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,760
Jia Dongping,

66
00:03:52,140 --> 00:03:53,820
what you care about isn't yourself;

67
00:03:54,780 --> 00:03:56,960
it's your fellow villagers.

68
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:12,700
Jia Dongping.

69
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:15,840
At your Yong'an Company,

70
00:04:16,220 --> 00:04:17,940
out of 117 employees,

71
00:04:18,940 --> 00:04:20,480
nearly half share the surname Jia.

72
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,440
If I'm not mistaken,

73
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:25,720
they're probably all from your village, right?

74
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,320
When you were 30,

75
00:04:28,740 --> 00:04:31,120
you gathered seven fellow villagers to start a crew.

76
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:34,880
Step by step, from bricklaying and plastering,

77
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:37,140
you built what is now Yong'an Company.

78
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,520
As far as I know,

79
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:42,760
six of those seven are still with you today.

80
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,320
What does that tell us?

81
00:04:46,320 --> 00:04:48,680
It shows you're a man of loyalty.

82
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,980
The state of the construction industry lately—

83
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,400
you know it better than I do.

84
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,080
Yet you're still holding on.

85
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,340
I believe

86
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,200
a big part of the reason

87
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,380
is that behind you,

88
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,080
there's a group who need your care,

89
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:05,440
brothers and fellow villagers who need your lead.

90
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:16,540
Do you know Yao Yang?

91
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,780
Five years ago on the Jianzhou Tunnel project,

92
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,360
because of multi-tier subcontracting,

93
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,600
he cut corners,

94
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,040
which eventually caused

95
00:05:23,420 --> 00:05:25,120
an accident with heavy casualties.

96
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:26,760
He was imprisoned for it.

97
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,240
While he was in prison,

98
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,000
his wife divorced him,

99
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,640
and his daughter died of leukemia.

100
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:36,080
A fine family was destroyed just like that.

101
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,540
I don't believe

102
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,680
someone who can't even take care of his family

103
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,920
can look out for the good friends

104
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,360
and brothers around him.

105
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,540
Not long ago,

106
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,960
he was just released from prison.

107
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:51,400
He chose to blow the whistle by attempting suicide,

108
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,600
just to seek justice

109
00:05:53,860 --> 00:05:54,880
for the fellow villagers who followed him.

110
00:05:56,880 --> 00:05:58,680
He's still lying in the hospital right now.

111
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,080
All of this

112
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,240
stems from

113
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,080
the corrupt mess in bidding and tendering.

114
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,800
If these bloodsucking parasites aren't purged,

115
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:07,200
Yao Yang's tragedy will happen

116
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,680
again and again.

117
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:16,740
Jia Dongping,

118
00:06:17,420 --> 00:06:19,460
do you know what day tomorrow is?

119
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:21,320
The Lu'an Energy project

120
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:22,600
opens for bidding tomorrow.

121
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,540
Five billion.

122
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,060
Do you think,

123
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:28,400
if they win this project

124
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:29,800
and subcontract it tier after tier,

125
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:32,960
how much will actually be left to build it?

126
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,440
One billion?

127
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,040
Two billion?

128
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,660
By then, how many people

129
00:06:38,820 --> 00:06:40,340
like your fellow villagers

130
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:41,980
will be working day and night

131
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:44,700
on that shoddy construction site?

132
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:45,980
Once

133
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:48,600
those shoddy projects under construction

134
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,360
or already in use run into problems,

135
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,400
at best they'll end up in prison,

136
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:54,860
and at worst,

137
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:56,500
their families will be ruined.

138
00:06:57,400 --> 00:07:00,320
Haven't we seen enough of this over the years?

139
00:07:05,080 --> 00:07:05,820
Jia Dongping,

140
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:08,080
I'll be honest with you.

141
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:10,620
This conversation

142
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:13,680
is your last chance.

143
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:15,900
Telling the truth

144
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,220
is what you, as a fellow villager,

145
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:19,540
owe most

146
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,000
to the people of your village.

147
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,160
Jia Dongping,

148
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,220
do you have anything to say?

149
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:30,640
I...

150
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:39,840
Wait.

151
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:42,780
I'll confess.

152
00:07:43,780 --> 00:07:44,720
I'll tell you everything.

153
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:49,040
Everything about the Jianzhou Xiba project,

154
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:51,860
I'll tell you all of it.

155
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:55,700
We've audited the Jianzhou Tunnel account books.

156
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,340
Through the money trails,

157
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:00,960
we confirmed the winning bidder subcontracted in tiers,

158
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:03,620
and that the subcontractors cut corners.

159
00:08:04,020 --> 00:08:06,020
Even more, we obtained evidence

160
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:07,840
of illicit deals between Jinxin Company

161
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,600
and the winning bidder for bid rigging.

162
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,600
The chain of evidence is complete.

163
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,280
We can apply for arrest warrants.

164
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,520
Our Task Force has obtained

165
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,220
criminal evidence against Jinxin Company

166
00:08:27,260 --> 00:08:29,080
and Du Qingbo himself.

167
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,440
Requesting arrest warrants.

168
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,200
Old Liu,

169
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:35,060
do you have anything to add?

170
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:35,720
Nothing.

171
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:36,800
Good.

172
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,360
Submit the requests

173
00:08:37,420 --> 00:08:38,660
through proper procedure.

174
00:08:38,920 --> 00:08:39,420
Yes, sir.

175
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:42,920
Take action immediately.

176
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:43,640
Yes, sir.

177
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:44,680
Yes, sir.

178
00:09:01,560 --> 00:09:02,360
Yanyan,

179
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,720
once you're there,

180
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,540
make sure to eat on time,

181
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,520
and don't be picky.

182
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:08,940
For everything,

183
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:10,620
do as Aunt Jiang says.

184
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:16,360
Dad will come join you in a few days.

185
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:19,200
Dad, you have to come soon.

186
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:21,040
I'll be waiting for you there.

187
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,340
Here.

188
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:39,820
Fasten your seatbelt.

189
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:51,520
I'll host today's bidding conference myself.

190
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,020
When the time comes,

191
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:55,000
their attention will all be on me.

192
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:57,080
Have a safe trip.

193
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:07,800
I've already deleted your videos.

194
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,520
Take good care of Yanyan.

195
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,040
If you don't treat Yanyan well,

196
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:17,640
even from the inside, I'll make you regret it.

197
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,100
Get in the car.

198
00:11:08,300 --> 00:11:09,420
What brings you here?

199
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,020
General Manager Jiang isn't feeling well.

200
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,560
I'm presiding in her place today.

201
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,400
Besides, this used to be my old line of work.

202
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:20,660
Having you here puts my mind even more at ease.

203
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,800
Representatives of the bidding companies,

204
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,940
good morning.

205
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:31,360
For the Lu'an Energy headquarters construction project,

206
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:34,560
today at the Municipal Public Resource Trading Center,

207
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,200
we are holding the bid-opening meeting.

208
00:11:36,580 --> 00:11:39,120
This session is audio- and video-recorded throughout,

209
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,520
under industry supervision

210
00:11:40,820 --> 00:11:42,180
and fully witnessed by the notary office.

211
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:44,520
If there are no objections,

212
00:11:44,520 --> 00:11:47,120
we will now unseal the bid documents

213
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:48,760
and read out the bids in order.

214
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:50,340
Don't move!

215
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:50,760
Stay where you are!

216
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,800
Jianzhou Public Security Bureau.

217
00:11:54,180 --> 00:11:55,680
Please cooperate with our investigation.

218
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:02,640
After evaluation by the review committee,

219
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,340
taking into account the bids,

220
00:12:05,020 --> 00:12:06,040
construction plans,

221
00:12:06,640 --> 00:12:08,240
and corporate qualifications,

222
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:10,000
it is now determined that

223
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,660
the top-ranked candidate is

224
00:12:21,140 --> 00:12:24,640
the Jianzhou No. 3 Construction and Fengyue Group consortium.

225
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,040
Congratulations!

226
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:29,420
That's wonderful!

227
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:45,420
Don't move!

228
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:46,100
Freeze!

229
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:46,720
Sit down!

230
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:47,400
Sit down and don't move!

231
00:12:47,640 --> 00:12:48,040
Sit down!

232
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:50,820
We are the Jianzhou PSB Economic Crime Detachment.

233
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:52,380
Please cooperate with our investigation.
